{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/692db844dcdade0a6976f64c22383622.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Harvested has all the fun you'd expect from a strategy game - resource management, base building, and epic combat.<br><br>Additionally, Harvested lets you play as a soldier on the field.<br><br>A carefully-designed and meticulously-tested control scheme gives you all the power of a real time strategy game and a top-down shooter. There is no need to switch modes - every action is at your fingertips all the time.<br><br>Harvested defies he status-quo of bland procedural generation with hand-crafted maps that cater to specific strategies and conceal rewarding secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/9aee1aa939624736ae7fcfbce5d08835.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Harvested features a massive strategy-driven and story-rich 18 mission campaign. Test your skills in carefully crafted missions.<br><br>These missions feature a variety of objectives inspired by the golden age of RTS. Some maps focus on economy, some focus on offense, and others are simply about doing whatever it takes to survive.<br><br>Additionally, Harvested features a handful of freeplay maps that cater to players who want to find out how long they can survive on Ceres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/d020ee51ca35d1a19d5d9531bc27cdbb.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>The world is yours to conquer - cut down forests, mine into the mountains, and fish from the local stream. But gathering takes time - why not hire some workers who will do it for you?<br><br>As your fortress grows you will build lumber mills, mining camps, and fishing wharfs to train workers who will gather resources for you.<br><br>Plant trees and pave roads. Paint rivers and fill them with fish. You are the builder and your base is your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/2bcc059e9d41ea8c587585003d6113f8.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Defend your base using exciting top-down shooter mechanics. Choose from a knife, pistol, shotgun, machine gun, or sniper rifle.<br><br>Build turrets and barricades for extra strength. Hire a variety of soldier units to back you up.<br><br>Two enemy factions, two unique AI types - enemies will attack you with swords, guns, explosives, and more.<br><br>There is never a boring moment in Harvested.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/893420?t=1616276828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/893420?t=1616276828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1616276828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1616276828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Harvested contains frequent acts of cartoon violence and blood.  All of this is displayed from far-away in a top-down pixel art style.  No \"gore\" such as body parts, organs, etc is displayed."},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/692db844dcdade0a6976f64c22383622.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Harvested has all the fun you'd expect from a strategy game - resource management, base building, and epic combat.<br><br>Additionally, Harvested lets you play as a soldier on the field.<br><br>A carefully-designed and meticulously-tested control scheme gives you all the power of a real time strategy game and a top-down shooter. There is no need to switch modes - every action is at your fingertips all the time.<br><br>Harvested defies he status-quo of bland procedural generation with hand-crafted maps that cater to specific strategies and conceal rewarding secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/9aee1aa939624736ae7fcfbce5d08835.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Harvested features a massive strategy-driven and story-rich 18 mission campaign. Test your skills in carefully crafted missions.<br><br>These missions feature a variety of objectives inspired by the golden age of RTS. Some maps focus on economy, some focus on offense, and others are simply about doing whatever it takes to survive.<br><br>Additionally, Harvested features a handful of freeplay maps that cater to players who want to find out how long they can survive on Ceres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/d020ee51ca35d1a19d5d9531bc27cdbb.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>The world is yours to conquer - cut down forests, mine into the mountains, and fish from the local stream. But gathering takes time - why not hire some workers who will do it for you?<br><br>As your fortress grows you will build lumber mills, mining camps, and fishing wharfs to train workers who will gather resources for you.<br><br>Plant trees and pave roads. Paint rivers and fill them with fish. You are the builder and your base is your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/extras/2bcc059e9d41ea8c587585003d6113f8.avif?t=1616276828\" width=602 height=130 /></span><br>Defend your base using exciting top-down shooter mechanics. Choose from a knife, pistol, shotgun, machine gun, or sniper rifle.<br><br>Build turrets and barricades for extra strength. Hire a variety of soldier units to back you up.<br><br>Two enemy factions, two unique AI types - enemies will attack you with swords, guns, explosives, and more.<br><br>There is never a boring moment in Harvested.","developers":["Vashta Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893420/header.jpg?t=1616276828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355599/b841554d68b4c91e2251fe5a4b0f849d0e70467d/1751159511/dash_av1.mpd?t=1616272253","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355599/b841554d68b4c91e2251fe5a4b0f849d0e70467d/1751159511/dash_h264.mpd?t=1616272253","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355599/b841554d68b4c91e2251fe5a4b0f849d0e70467d/1751159511/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1616272253","id":256826816,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256826816/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1616272253"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355598/75ad5a078912f6766b0900e59de5b1e0462f1a03/1751159506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1616272260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355598/75ad5a078912f6766b0900e59de5b1e0462f1a03/1751159506/dash_h264.mpd?t=1616272260","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/893420/355598/75ad5a078912f6766b0900e59de5b1e0462f1a03/1751159506/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1616272260","id":256826815,"name":"Story Chapter 5 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared